#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-GurumNetworks-GurumDDS.rst:17
msgid ""
"GurumNetworks GurumDDS is an alternative middleware implementation for ROS "
"systems that need a supported Data Distribution Service (DDS) backend. This "
"article describes how to install ``rmw_gurumdds``, select it as your active "
"RMW implementation, and verify that it is working. After you follow these "
"steps, you can run ROS nodes using GurumDDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-GurumNetworks-GurumDDS.rst:21
msgid ""
"``rmw_gurumdds`` is an implementation of the ROS middleware interface using "
"GurumNetworks GurumDDS. For more information about GurumDDS, visit the "
"`GurumNetworks website <https://gurum.cc/index_eng>`_."
msgstr ""

